<title>INDIA: India GE Ship down 3.3 pct after results.</title>
<headline>India GE Ship down 3.3 pct after results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of India's G.E. Shipping fell one rupee or 3.3 percent to 29 rupees in late trade on Tuesday after the firm said its first half net fell below the year-ago, traders said.</p>
</text>
